**Changing things later:** speakers, stations, music folder and the look on the card's ⚙ button (*Save* writes into every Cantabile card); TV players, announcements, Spotify / Tidal keys and the Assist tool under [Settings → Devices & services]({integrations_url}) → Cantabile → **Configure** – where this wizard can be run again, also step by step.

